                <pb facs="0450" n="378" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg378"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 22113/15.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Brown.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-11-11"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wilson informs Mr. Brown that the department has been informed by the
                    minister of Honduras at Washington that the launch of the Perlas Co., held by
                    Honduras, has been ordered released.</p>
            </div>
